{"seq":2,"slug":"pricing","title":"保险精算与定价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"actuarial-pricing-fundamentals","title":"精算定价基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/actuarial-pricing-fundamentals","wordCount":1847,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"loss-distribution-models","title":"损失分布模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/loss-distribution-models","wordCount":2093,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"reinsurance-pricing","title":"再保险定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/reinsurance-pricing","wordCount":2074,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"保险精算与定价\">保险精算与定价</h1><p>本章进入保险公司的&quot;引擎室&quot;——精算定价。精算师的核心任务是将未来不确定的赔付义务转化为当下确定的保费收入，这一转化过程依赖严密的概率模型和统计推断。</p>\n<p>三篇文档覆盖从单一保单定价到再保险层级定价的完整链条：先掌握精算定价的基本框架与原理，然后深入损失分布建模的技术细节，最后理解再保险市场中保险公司如何进一步转移和分散风险。</p>\n"}